70><c>this </c><00:00:14.471><c>word </c><00:00:14.472><c>because </c><00:00:14.473><c>when </c><00:00:14.474><c>the </c><00:00:14.475><c>n-word  </c><00:00:14.476><c>comes </c><00:00:14.477><c>to </c><00:00:14.478><c>school </c><00:00:14.479><c>or </c><00:00:14.480><c>really </c><00:00:14.481><c>anywhere </c><00:00:14.482><c>it  </c><00:00:14.483><c>brings </c><00:00:14.484><c>with </c><00:00:14.485><c>it </c><00:00:14.486><c>all </c><00:00:14.487><c>of </c><00:00:14.488><c>the </c><00:00:14.489><c>complicated  </c><00:00:14.490><c>history </c><00:00:14.491><c>of </c><00:00:14.492><c>us </c><00:00:14.493><c>racism </c><00:00:14.494><c>the </c><00:00:14.495><c>nation's  </c><00:00:14.496><c>history  </c><00:00:14.497><c>and </c><00:00:14.498><c>my </c><00:00:14.499><c>own </c><00:00:14.500><c>right </c><00:00:14.501><c>here </c><00:00:14.502><c>right </c><00:00:14.503><c>now </c><00:00:14.504><c>there's  </c><00:00:14.505><c>no </c><00:00:14.506><c>avoiding </c><00:00:14.507><c>it</c>

